   "content": "<p>(2b) فَكَيْفَ إِذَآ أَصَٰبَتْهُم مُّصِيبَةٌۢ بِمَا قَدَّمَتْ أَيْدِيهِمْ ثُمَّ جَآءُوكَ يَحْلِفُونَ بِٱللَّهِ إِنْ أَرَدْنَآ إِلَّآ إِحْسَٰنًۭا وَتَوْفِيقًا — What cause of misfortune reaching the hypocrites is stated in the verse, and what reaction do they show to it?</p><p>(3a) وَلَوْ أَنَّا كَتَبْنَا عَلَيْهِمْ أَنِ ٱقْتُلُوٓا۟ أَنفُسَكُمْ أَوِ ٱخْرُجُوا۟ مِن دِيَٰرِكُم مَّا فَعَلُوهُ إِلَّا قَلِيلٌۭ مِّنْهُمْ ۖ وَلَوْ أَنَّهُمْ فَعَلُوا۟ مَا يُوعَظُونَ بِهِۦ لَكَانَ خَيْرًۭا لَّهُمْ وَأَشَدَّ تَثْبِيتًۭا — Write the translation of the verse.</p><p>(3b) وَمَن يُطِعِ ٱللَّهَ وَٱلرَّسُولَ فَأُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ مَعَ ٱلَّذِينَ أَنْعَمَ ٱللَّهُ عَلَيْهِم مِّنَ ٱلنَّبِيِّۦنَ وَٱلصِّدِّيقِينَ وَٱلشُّهَدَآءِ وَٱلصَّٰلِحِينَ ۚ وَحَسُنَ أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ رَفِيقًۭا — What has been told in the verse about the blessed servants of Allah Almighty, and who are they?</p><p>Activities for students</p><p>Learn the commands of tayammum and its method from your teachers.</p><p>Collect information about the blessed servants of Allah Almighty stated in this lesson and discuss it.</p><p>Guidance for teachers</p><p>Have the students prepare a list of the people with whom Allah Almighty has commanded kindness in this lesson, and discuss the various practical forms of kindness.</p><p>Make the students well aware of the concept of taghut, and by pointing out its manifestations in the present age, encourage them to avoid it.</p><p>Acquaint the students with the broad concept of trust (wealth, position, secret, responsibility, knowledge, etc.) and make its importance clear from the Qur&#x27;an and Hadith.</p>",
