   "content": "<p>إِنَّا عَرَضْنَا ٱلْأَمَانَةَ عَلَى ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ وَٱلْجِبَالِ فَأَبَيْنَ أَن يَحْمِلْنَهَا وَأَشْفَقْنَ مِنْهَا وَحَمَلَهَا ٱلْإِنسَٰنُ ۖ إِنَّهُۥ كَانَ ظَلُومًۭا جَهُولًۭا ﴿٧٢﴾\nLo! We offered the trust unto the heavens and the earth and the hills, but they shrank from bearing it and were afraid of it. And man assumed it. Lo! he hath proved a tyrant and a fool. (33:72)</p><p>لِّيُعَذِّبَ ٱللَّهُ ٱلْمُنَٰفِقِينَ وَٱلْمُنَٰفِقَٰتِ وَٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ وَٱلْمُشْرِكَٰتِ وَيَتُوبَ ٱللَّهُ عَلَى ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ وَٱلْمُؤْمِنَٰتِ ۗ وَكَانَ ٱللَّهُ غَفُورًۭا رَّحِيمًۢا ﴿٧٣﴾\nSo Allah punisheth hypocritical men and hypocritical women, and idolatrous men and idolatrous women. But Allah pardoneth believing men and believing women, and Allah is ever Forgiving, Merciful. (33:73)</p><p>Matters of knowledge and action</p><p>We should remember Allah Almighty abundantly, and especially in the morning and evening state the glorification and sanctification of Allah Almighty. Allah Almighty sends down mercy upon such people, the angels pray for mercy for them, and Allah Almighty brings those engaged in His remembrance out of the darkness of sin into the light of obedience.</p><p>In social life a person should not look only at his own desire or need, but should also keep in mind that his behaviour does not become a cause of any trouble or distress for others, nor do his unnecessary words waste the time of others.</p><p>When a Muslim woman goes out of her home for some need, her manner should be such that her dress is simple and her gait modest; further, her body should be covered with a large sheet. This is a sign that she is a modest woman, and the wisdom of this veil is to keep believing women safe from the harassment of mischievous people.</p><p>Vocabulary</p>",
