   "content": "<p>Matters of knowledge and action</p><p>Prophethood and messengership are the bounty of Allah Almighty, and He favoured with this bounty whomever He willed. Accordingly Allah Almighty honoured Sayyiduna Muhammad, the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), with the distinction of Khatam al-Anbiya&#x27; and Sayyid al-Mursalin. It is the bounty of Allah Almighty upon us that He granted us the honour of being the Ummah of the Holy Messenger (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him).</p><p>The example of the Jews who turn away from acting upon the commands of Allah Almighty has been given as that of a donkey, because even if books of philosophy are loaded onto a donkey, it does not become a philosopher by them. In the same way, the example of any nation that does not benefit from the divine Book is also like that of the donkey.</p><p>After the Friday adhan one should leave all occupations and go to offer the Friday prayer. The tragedy is that often people prefer play, amusement, trifles, economic activities and other occupations, and reach the Friday gathering late. It is necessary that with the Friday adhan one should leave buying and selling, business, employment and all other occupations and make arrangements to reach the mosque quickly to listen to the sermon early.</p><p>Vocabulary</p>",
